<li>Face recognition for up to six users, each with a personal Home Screen with apps and widgets.</li><br/>
<li>Siri AI, with conversations that continue in the Siri app on other Apple devices.</li><br/>
<li>Personal content from Messages, FaceTime, Calendar, Reminders, and Find My, shown when the enrolled user is recognized and their iPhone or iPad is nearby and recently unlocked.</li><br/>
