<li>FaceTime with Center Stage, Messages by voice or keyboard, and Intercom.</li><br/>
<li>Step-by-step recipes from the web with hands-free timers.</li><br/>
<li>Smart home controls, including a Home Camera face that shows up to nine live camera feeds.</li><br/>
<li>With a supported iCloud+ subscription, recognition of people, pets, packages, and vehicles from compatible cameras.</li><br/>
<li>Smoke and carbon monoxide alarm sound detection.</li><br/>
<li>Support for Apple Home Collection accessories, other "Works with Apple Home" accessories, and Matter.</li><br/>
